# Configuration of the app

## ENV

On the mobile side

```bash
EXPO_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL=YOUR_SERVER_URL
EXPO_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL=YOUR_SERVER_SOCKET_URL (Majority the same as Server URL)
```

On the backend side
if dev mode file must to be .env.development

```bash
SERVER_PORT=
DATABASE_USER=
DATABASE_PASSWORD=
DATABASE_HOST=
DATABASE_NAME=
JWT_SECRET_ACCESS_TOKEN=
JWT_SECRET_REFRESH_TOKEN=
```